{"id":10772052398,"name":"Defender's Depot 2 - Tower Defense","desc":"Welcome to Defender's Depot 2, build towers and traps to defend from waves of enemies in an epic new tower defense game!\n\n⚔️Use towers and traps to defeat waves of enemies\n⬆️Upgrade your defenses to unlock new abilities\n💥Defeat challenging enemies and hardcore bosses\n✨Rebirth to unlock LEGENDARY towers \n🔨Strategically forge your path to victory\n🕹️Compete against or with friends\n\n💎Join the group for +100 gems!💎","path":"/game/10772052398-defender-s-depot-2-tower-defense","slug":"10772052398-defender-s-depot-2-tower-defense","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1bc3cdfedfcc775c574ad7816175d9a8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://scriptblox.com/images/no-script.webp","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":36,"visitor":33092792,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-08-13T18:42:27.152Z","creator":{"name":"Stouts Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Defender's-Depot-2-Tower-Defense-AUTO-CRATE-SCRIPT-7019","_id":"64d92413688a72f46b43e8e8","title":"AUTO CRATE SCRIPT","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c789a3","gameId":10772052398,"name":"Defender's Depot 2 - Tower Defense","imageUrl":"/images/sb/no-script.webp","placeId":10772052398},"features":"Created by protonn#0\nFeatures:\n\nAUTO CRATE","tags":[],"script":"getgenv().settings = {\n    ['AutoCrate'] = true\n}\n\nlocal player = game:GetService(\"Players\").LocalPlayer\nfunction collectCrates()\n    for _,v in next, workspace:GetChildren() do \n        if string.find(v.Name, 'Crate') and v.ClassName == 'MeshPart' then \n            v.CanCollide = false\n            v.CFrame  = player.Character.PrimaryPart.CFrame\n        end \n    end \nend \n\nwhile getgenv().settings.AutoCrate and task.wait() do\n    collectCrates()\nend","owner":{"_id":"62de3be20ed8f1594a993227","username":"sturpeegg","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.p